{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運田徑項目，港隊上午出戰兩項100米決賽。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n女子方面，任國芬在T36級100米賽事，跑出今季最佳的15秒76，取得第5名。隊友王穎晞及余春麗分別以15秒81及18秒28完成賽事，排名第6及第7。賽事由國家隊代表史逸婷，以13秒56奪得金牌。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n男子T35級100米決賽方面，港隊代表鮑錐耀，以14秒96完成賽事，取得第6名。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:20:05.681416+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:39:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T05:57:46.988600+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:17:40.883542+00:00","content_hash":"653db97ed9838fc3eac7b2846eef0cc5953114aa66ba6395b051e2bf8fa71a40","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}